{"id":"vod_md_3782","vodId":"3782","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"在下坂本，有何贵干？","name_cn":"在下坂本，有何贵干？","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230831-1/c94728e0cce0f08721aa78486727c7fc.jpg"},"summary":"县立学文高中一年级2班，那里有位刚一入学就得到全校注目的男子，他的名字叫坂本（绿川光 配音）。他戴着黑边框眼镜，个人特征是左眼下的泪痣。他不但相貌英俊，着装整齐，而且眼神凌厉，一举一动都华丽潇洒，帅气爆表，因此总能成为众人的焦点，受到女生们的疯狂追捧，但是也因此引起不少同龄男生的嫉妒，包括同班同学阿酱（杉田智和 配音），以及高二级学长8823（游佐浩二 配音）。对面男生们花样百出的陷害和报复，坂本总能帅气满分地完美解决这些麻烦，让男生们甘拜下风。本剧改编自日本漫画家佐野菜见原作的同名漫画。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-31 07:17:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/iWkEYQpQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/Or1gni4p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/Sauvw8FC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/ge3lGT6O/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/qLw9vl30/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/SBmrdVGP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/9FI47yWG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/GjzXw693/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/YXpJakJQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/2lHJUT5N/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/oL6wIm2Q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/35h9bh4q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/HSK8oQUZ/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:36.863Z"}